      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Log in to the UD Web Forms systems to specify your payroll direct deposit account. Have your checking account information ready. All UD paychecks are directly deposited to your bank account.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="list-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
      <span style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Employee Demographic Data
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Log in to the UD Web Forms to provide information for Human Resources records.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="list-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
      <span style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> W-4
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Log in to the UD Web Forms to complete a W-4 tax form.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="list-item" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
      <span style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Bayh-Dole Agreement
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Log in to UD Web Forms to agree to the assignment of intellectual property and compliance with the Bayh-Dole Act.</p>
