    <div class="list-item" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
      <span style="color: blue; font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> Voluntary Self-Identification of Disability (optional)
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Visit the HR website to submit a Voluntary Self-Identification of Disability Form and/or learn more about accommodations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="list-item" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
      <span style="color: green; font-weight: bold;">&#10003;</span> I-9
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Please look for an email from DoNotReply@talentwise.com prior to your appointment to start the digital Form I-9. Here is an instructional video available to guide you through this process. *Please remember to bring your original I-9 to your in-person appointment.</p>
